---
import InnerPage from '../../layouts/InnerPage.astro';
import { BOOK_CALL_URL } from '../../config/site';
---

<InnerPage
	title="Relay"
	description="Relay by TeleTrex: AI that answers leads and customers in your voice—fast, friendly, and on-brand."
>
	<h1>Relay</h1>
	<p class="page-lead">
		<strong>Instant, on-brand answers for every lead.</strong> Relay is the product we reach for when
		businesses are losing deals to slow follow-up—or burning hours on the same five questions.
	</p>

	<p class="prose-block">
		It plugs into how you already talk to people: your site, email handoffs, or the channels you care
		about. We train it on your positioning, pricing guardrails, and tone so it sounds like a sharp member
		of your team—not a generic bot.
	</p>

	<h2 class="section-title">Best for</h2>
	<ul class="prose-block bullets">
		<li>Teams that get a steady stream of “quick questions” before someone buys or books</li>
		<li>Founders and sales folks who can’t be in the inbox 24/7</li>
		<li>Businesses that want speed <em>and</em> control (approvals, escalation, and plain-language limits)</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 class="section-title">What you get</h2>
	<ul class="prose-block bullets">
		<li>Faster first response—so fewer leads go quiet</li>
		<li>Consistent answers on pricing, services, and next steps</li>
		<li>A clear path to a human when the conversation needs one</li>
	</ul>

	<p class="prose-block relay-actions">
		<a class="btn btn--primary" href={BOOK_CALL_URL}>Book a call</a>
		<a class="inline-back" href="/products">← All products</a>
	</p>
</InnerPage>

<style>
	.bullets {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
	}

	.bullets li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.inline-back {
		font-size: 0.9375rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--color-text-muted);
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.inline-back:hover {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}

	.relay-actions {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem 1rem;
	}
</style>
